; Positional slot-local forms: a form's POSITIONAL slot declares inline
; (form …) children directly under the parent (form …). A form-shaped
; positional value resolves local-first — a local shadows a same-named
; global, falls back additively to the global catalog, and a head matching
; neither is `unknown_local_form` at the PARENT form's path (the positional
; slot). This is the scoping PNGine's `bind-group` needs so `entry` can be a
; positional local without colliding with the global shader-entry `entry`.
;
; `bind-group` positional locals: `entry` (needs :binding) SHADOWS the global
; `entry` (needs :at); `buffer` is local-only; `group` nests BOTH carriers — a
; positional-local `leaf` and a key-local `badge` on `:tag`. `pass` is a
; global form reachable by the additive fallback. Inline locals with no
; explicit `:positional` imply `.any`.
(plugin :name plf-test :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name bind-group
    (form :name entry (key :name binding :type number :optional false))
    (form :name buffer (key :name slot :type number :optional false))
    (form :name group
      (form :name leaf)
      (key :name tag :type form
        (form :name badge))))
  (form :name pass)
  (form :name entry (key :name at :type symbol :optional false)))
